  "notes": "Heroes Battlegrounds is a fighting game from the group more awesome games yo, based on superhero anime. You pick a hero or villain, each with their own set of moves and an ultimate, then drop into a shared map to punch, dash and combo other players. Fighting bosses and playing a character raises its mastery, which unlocks a stronger mastered version of that fighter.\n\nCodes here give either free emotes or mastery progress. Mastery progress is the better reward, because it speeds up unlocking a mastered character, while emotes are just for fun. New codes usually drop when a new mastered character comes out, after maintenance or delays, and around holidays. The developers post them in the Discord and on the Trello board.",
