  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Where do I type Heroes Battlegrounds codes?",
      "a": "There is no code box. Type the code into the Roblox chat with !code in front of it, like !code WELOVEDELAYSITHINK, then press Enter."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why did my code not work in chat?",
      "a": "Check that there is a space after !code and that the code is in capital letters. Older codes like AZUREMASTERYULT and LOVESICKKILLERULT have been reported as expired."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does mastery progress do?",
      "a": "It fills a character's mastery bar, and a full bar unlocks the mastered version of that character with stronger moves. EXPLOSIONHEROMASTERYRELEASE gives 5 progress."
    }
  ],
